{"seq":2,"slug":"global-history","title":"全球史前沿","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":3,"docCount":9,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/history/global-history","introMarkdown":"# 全球史前沿 简介\n\n全球史（global history）是当代历史学最具活力的研究方向之一，它拒绝以单一民族国家为分析单元，转而追踪跨越政治疆界的物质流动、观念传播、人口迁徙和生态交换，揭示不同文明之间深层的相互依存和共同演化。全球史不等于\"世界各地历史的简单拼贴\"，而是一种方法论立场——关注\"连接\"（connections）如何塑造了地方性的历史经验。\n\n本知识库面向博士阶段的历史学研究者，系统介绍全球史领域三个核心前沿方向的理论框架和研究方法。\n\n第一章**关联史学**聚焦于 Sanjay Subrahmanyam 的\"关联史\"范式和 Michael Werner 与 Bénédicte Zimmermann 的\"交叉史\"（histoire croisée）方法，探讨如何在方法论层面超越比较史学的局限，真正把握不同历史进程之间的纠缠关系。同时考察以商品链和知识流通为线索的全球史叙事策略。\n\n第二章**环境史**将人类活动置于地球生态系统的宏观框架中，追踪气候变化与文明兴衰的关系、生态帝国主义下的物种交换，以及\"人类世\"概念对历史学认识论的挑战。环境史要求研究者跨越人文与自然科学的学科边界，使用气候代理数据、孢粉分析等自然科学证据。\n\n第三章**跨国史**从民族国家叙事框架中突围，以移民网络、跨国组织和全球治理机制为研究对象，揭示\"国际\"秩序如何在民族国家\"之间\"和\"之上\"被建构。跨国史与全球史有交叉但侧重不同——跨国史更关注行动者如何跨越国界运作，而全球史关注系统性的全球连接。\n\n建议学习路径：先从关联史学的理论框架入手，理解全球史的方法论基础；再进入环境史，体验自然科学证据与历史叙事的融合；最后通过跨国史，掌握超越国家框架进行历史分析的具体策略。三章内容互为补充，共同构成全球史研究的方法论工具箱。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"connected-histories","title":"关联史学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/history/global-history/connected-histories","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"entangled-and-connected-frameworks","title":"纠缠史与关联史框架","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/history/global-history/connected-histories/entangled-and-connected-frameworks"},{"seq":2,"slug":"commodity-chains-and-exchange-networks","title":"商品链与交换网络","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/history/global-history/connected-histories/commodity-chains-and-exchange-networks"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cross-cultural-encounters-and-knowledge","title":"跨文化接触与知识流通","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/history/global-history/connected-histories/cross-cultural-encounters-and-knowledge"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"environmental-history","title":"环境史","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/history/global-history/environmental-history","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"climate-civilization-and-collapse","title":"气候、文明与崩溃","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/history/global-history/environmental-history/climate-civilization-and-collapse"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ecological-imperialism-and-exchange","title":"生态帝国主义与物种交换","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/history/global-history/environmental-history/ecological-imperialism-and-exchange"},{"seq":3,"slug":"anthropocene-historiography","title":"人类世史学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/history/global-history/environmental-history/anthropocene-historiography"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"transnational-history","title":"跨国史","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/history/global-history/transnational-history","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"beyond-the-nation-state","title":"超越民族国家框架","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/history/global-history/transnational-history/beyond-the-nation-state"},{"seq":2,"slug":"migration-diaspora-and-identity","title":"移民、离散与身份","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/history/global-history/transnational-history/migration-diaspora-and-identity"},{"seq":3,"slug":"global-governance-and-institutions","title":"全球治理与国际制度","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/history/global-history/transnational-history/global-governance-and-institutions"}]}]}